  "question": {
    "text": "Both $\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}(\\mathrm{CO})_4\\right]$ and $\\left[\\mathrm{Ni}(\\mathrm{CN})_4\\right]^{2-}$ are diamagnetic. The hybridisations of nickel in these complexes, respectively, are",
